Upstream declares the license as "GNU General Public License v3 or later
(GPLv3+)". The full license text is in LICENSE at the repository root.

Known modifications made in Cube Bench:

  - Import paths rewritten from top-level modules to the
    cube_bench.optimal namespace.
  - Pruning tables are created in and loaded from
    src/cube_bench/optimal/graph/ (see pruning.py).

The solver's search, its pruning-table construction and its face-turn
metric semantics are used as provided upstream; solutions are returned
with the "(<n>f*)" suffix marking a proven-optimal length.
